   "en": "Aji Ichi Monme - Sekai no Naka no Washoku"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "味いちもんめ　世界の中の和食"
   },
   {
    "en": "Flavor, One Monme: Japanese Food Around The World"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The sixth series in the popular gourmet manga franchise *Aji Ichi Monme*.\n\nIhashi Satoru, who has trained in various places in Japan, resumes his training in a new place!! His new stage is Ginza, a town lined with high-end restaurants! He even closes his restaurant “Rakuan” in Kagurazaka to take on the challenge of rediscovering Japanese cuisine! Don't miss Ihashi's efforts to get to the heart of what Japanese cuisine is from a global perspective, even as he is perplexed by the large number of foreign customers!"
  },
